## Scheduling infrastructure present but NOT used at startup

### `internal/scheduler` — full cron scheduler, zero production wiring

- Package exists with `Scheduler.Register`, `Start`, cron parsing, per-job `time.Timer` loops.
- **No file outside `internal/scheduler/` imports it** (repo-wide grep finds no `usememos/memos/internal/scheduler` importers).
- `Scheduler.Start()` is never called from `cmd/memos` or `server`.

